          "content": "Aurora Industries here. I have significant demand in the 7-10 window (6.4kW total across 3 machines: 1.6kW water heater + 3.2kW HVAC + 1.6kW HVAC). Looking at Biomass capacity during 7-10 (1.2-1.7kW), this won't work without overflow. I'm considering using Wind for part of this load since I have exclusive access. For my early morning 4-6 window, I have 2.6kW refrigeration that could use Biomass (3.7-4.4kW capacity looks good) or split with Wind. Evening 19-23 window I have 2.9kW refrigeration that fits within Biomass capacity. How are others planning to use Biomass during 7-12 period?",
